 equipment"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1439540-i20240215-v6","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2415-b","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1439540-i20240215","date":"2024-02-15","original_code":"746.2415(b)","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-02-28","finding":"AP Cribs - Only Snug Fitting Sheet and Crib Mattress Cover Allowed if Infant Younger than 12 Months of Age: During this inspection a mirror was observed in the crib of a five-month-old.","topic":"facilities","source_record_id":"1026397326","violation_type_title":"AP Cribs - Only Snug Fitting Sheet and Crib Mattress Cover Allowed if Infant Younger than 12 Months of Age (26 TAC §746.2415(b))","topic_label":"Facilities & equipment"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1439540-i20240215-v7","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-631-a","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1439540-i20240215","date":"2024-02-15","original_code":"746.631(a)","severity":"medium_high","severity_label":"Medium-high risk","status":"corrected","status_label":"Correction verified 2024-02-28","finding":"Sign-in and Sign-out Tracking System: During this inspection the sign in and out information via the ProCare app was not immediately available for review. Once reviewed the sign in and out log it showed the following:    None of the children in the Senior Infant room were signed in.  Eight of thirteen children in the Toddler I class was signed in.  Eight of fifteen children in the preschool room was signed in.  The sign in and out log also showed eleven school age children were signed in but none were present at the operation.","topic":"supervision","source_record_id":"1026517654","violation_type_title":"Sign-in and Sign-out Tracking System (26 TAC §746.631(a))","topic_label":"Supervision & ratios"},{"id":"tx-hhsc-1439540-i20240215-v8","violation_type_id":"tx-tac-746-2427","inspection_id":"tx-hhsc-1439540-i20240215","date":"2024-02-15","original_code":"746.2427","severity":"high","severity_label":"High risk","status":"corrected","s